1
00:00:00,410 --> 00:00:03,770
Tonight's selection:
Brussels sprouts.

2
00:00:03,770 --> 00:00:04,880
(Howard:)Really?

3
00:00:04,890 --> 00:00:07,600
(Howard:)You're changing the
Sheldonian calendar?

4
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:10,720
(Sheldon:)It's a small price to pay.
For what?

5
00:00:10,720 --> 00:00:13,260
(Leonard:)No, no, don't ask.
Sorry, sorry, sorry,
sorry, sorry.

6
00:00:13,260 --> 00:00:15,560
(Sheldon:)In order to live long enough
to fuse my consciousness

7
00:00:15,560 --> 00:00:18,200
(Sheldon:)with cybernetics,
I need to change my diet.

8
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:20,450
(Penny:)Wait. Cybernetics is
robot stuff, right?

9
00:00:20,450 --> 00:00:21,430
(Sheldon:)Correct.

10
00:00:21,430 --> 00:00:22,870
(Penny:)So you want to turn yourself

11
00:00:22,870 --> 00:00:23,940
(Penny:)into some sort of robot?

12
00:00:23,940 --> 00:00:26,140
(Sheldon:)Essentially, yes.

13
00:00:26,140 --> 00:00:27,410
(Penny:)Okay, here's my question.

14
00:00:27,410 --> 00:00:28,820
(Penny:)Didn't you already do that?

15
00:00:28,830 --> 00:00:30,130
(Sheldon:)No.

16
00:00:31,550 --> 00:00:33,800
(Sheldon:)Flattering, but sadly, no.

17
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:37,280
(Sheldon:)I'm also planning
to begin an exercise regimen

18
00:00:37,280 --> 00:00:39,720
(Sheldon:)designed to strengthen
my cardiovascular system.

19
00:00:39,720 --> 00:00:41,970
(Sheldon:)AKA jogging.

20
00:00:41,970 --> 00:00:43,560
(Penny:)Wait. Honey,
have you ever run before?

21
00:00:43,560 --> 00:00:44,820
(Sheldon:)Certainly.

22
00:00:44,830 --> 00:00:49,050
(Sheldon:)I've run from bullies, dogs,
angry chickens...

23
00:00:49,980 --> 00:00:52,680
(Sheldon:)and one particularly
persistent P.E. teacher

24
00:00:52,680 --> 00:00:59,020
(Sheldon:)determined to bend me over
and give me a scoliosis test.

